OL,3,GNEWSA'Without a job, you're quite
OL,4,Alimited,' say Neets
OL,5,
OL,6,FYoung people in Kent who are not in
OL,7,Fwork say not having a job can leave
OL,8,Flife "quite limited", and a financial
OL,9,Fstruggle.
OL,11,FA report by former Labour minister Alan
OL,12,FMilburn, due to be published on
OL,13,FTuesday, will detail a support plan for
OL,14,Fthe nearly one million young people
OL,15,Faged 16-24 who are classed as not in
OL,16,Femployment, education or training
OL,17,F(Neet) in the UK.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,322,320,200,140,0,100
