OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F321A1794907550
OL,1,W5j 5Q5 7575747575x0w1w1 w17571
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'Without a job, you're quite
OL,4,Alimited,' say Neets
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Milburn report is expected to
OL,7,Finclude a range of recommendations
OL,8,Fincluding a legal guarantee of a job or
OL,9,Ftraining, and reducing some benefits
OL,10,Ffor those under 25 years old.
OL,12,FAlex Stewart, 19, who is Neet, says
OL,13,F"you're quite limited as to what you
OL,14,Fcan do" without a job, and it is harder
OL,15,F"putting yourself out there to show who
OL,16,Fyou truly are".
